stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Incremental parser has two terminal outcomes
  accDescr: Open retains or emits frames on valid pushes; clean EOF enters Ended, residual EOF or a bound violation enters Failed; neither terminal state reopens.
[*] --> Open
  Open --> Open: push / retain or emit
  Open --> Ended: EOF, empty tail
  Open --> Failed: EOF, partial frame
  Open --> Failed: bound violation
  state "Ended" as Ended
  state "Failed" as Failed
